<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2 PE -Yemsa New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Phexiros</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Phexirosni wosiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Phexiros</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Phex.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wosi Phexirosni Hepsa wosiya</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gachgiru</para>
  <para style="ip">Wosi Phexirosni hepsani wosiyaas tichchenaas showo dimta feese ibeti kiristanani meyakwa. Wosiyaas arkiron besifanaas esha assinynyani meeni mangu wostoosewa baasso assusnen ane ya mangu amalani fooson tugga'okwa. Tustera ya rakkoosik kota sinni wuzaas Yesusnin aafak biye baassonawa assifeen odobesiisik ode asuni meya aatisete asuski kamo Ha'oosi chowanonnawa Daam Yesusni chowanonna zaga aruni danawa. Tichi bar arkiron gasasire biinaas «Kiristoos wolle aafa yoonawuza» yifa esha assustawa. Es baron besire makefena kabaasik «Kiristoos wolle yoobaason woksinaas Ha'oos asu zuuttere boor'baassin wolunaktano oonu tishunak aane sholefe sinna boor'awa»</para>
  <para style="iot">Matsafaas Siruk Ephna Ephobaas</para>
  <para style="io1">Gachgiru <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristanani teegto <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:3-21">1:3-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Esh assinynyani meya <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosni wolle yoo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 3:1-18">3:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Yesus Kiristoosni wostinynyanawa wosina sina ta Simon phexiros;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Ha'oniiskinnawa hetni sina Yesus Kiristoosnikinna bestefa ookooski kamo danniisne fa ulfinto amanto dana nittok;<verse eid="2PE 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Ha'oosonnawa Daamni Yesusninna aruk Ha'oosi otumnewa nagane nittok arkifawungwa.<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ha'oosi Teegonewa Korune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>Ulfinbaasiknawa mai'baasikna innotin teege baron aruniisik Ha'o sinbaasi hugna kaaknawa Ha'ooson girsuni fo foonikna zuuttambaase asin innok imi. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>Ulfinbaasiknawa garambaasik ulfinto waagba faana akama inya sina abdiison danni. Es barki kamo mangu safaraastan kabi chowa han daasta fa mangu eenantoossin kessa Ha'oosi haalanon haa'er sinetiwa.<verse eid="2PE 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Es bari boor'a han wuzaasikito nittok daytonak chimti; amantoosta ma'aason; ma'aasta aruuson; <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>Arusta dey teetni ha'suuson; teetni ha'suusta dey fakiyak chimme fooson; fakiyak chimme foosta dey Ha'oni shiiphooson; <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>Ha'oni shiiphosta dey ayna ayna asi shunooson; ayna ayna asi shunoosta keeshtanaason daysuti. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Es barikito arkira nittok faafaanane Daamni Yesus Kiristoosnin arusik ke'nor wedey gaanniti foonto sinnoytimato nittotin oodanawa. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Sinuntano es effatena wuzaasikito basaassi tishina asu wokanon fa wuzason biyak chimnoy aaftishuwa; aata boor'baassin kayimbaason daagewa.<verse eid="2PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Es bari boor'a ayni meyane! Teegtontisonnawa kortontiisonna zagguk zeemotiistan arkissira chimtiwa. Ekka zagaatine aafe tuusa'oti wuza. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Es barik Koi'ba foontonon fooni Daamniiskinawa het sina Yesus Kiristoosni taatoossina girutik tuumanon nittok imtona.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Es wuzasikitonon awune faaron arifetiknu ephpha taati futoosik dey zagira yerefetiknu han wuzasikitonon nittok yaadassuuson aafa beyana wuza. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Han daasta kaak faana kabaasik nittotin wonna wonna guzguus likki sinnatu taak bestefa. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>Daamni Yesus Kiristoos ammanon kisire makenaasimato woknoy kaanaas ashnaastan oor kesanamato arifawungwa. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Hash han ta nittotin guzgit faanaas kitinanneen orfo han wuzasikitonon wonna wonna yaadatok chimatikwa.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosni Ulfinaason Biya Baasso Maksete Zaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Daamni Yesus Kiristoosni hugnaasewa hepsa yoona bare nittok makefeni kabaasik inno teetniisik addabaason aafniisik biini boor'atu zaala makenitano asuni techmak makte tochok zoonusteratawa. <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>«Barik girefana dey shunfana naata haniiswa» yifa kaama arkitto ulfinaas barik yaafana kabaasik Aba Ha'ooskin ulfinnewa addane ephphetewa. <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Inno dey barneen ane kayma aamaasta faani kabaasik es kaamaas den saman ya. <verse eid="2PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Es barikito zuuttambaase raajjuni meya makesete bar futo sinnamato artewa. Es bari boor'a talmaas wonanakfana kabaasiknawa wonni masko nitto nibaassi chaarona kabaneen talmaassi fa tonaas tishunoynamato oodtefanasimato nitto dey han kaamaason oodfaatine ma'aron zagitiwa. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Zuuttambaase asiistan zeemma es baron arutik sholsuwa; korto matsafaassi fa raajini kaama zuuttambaase asin oonu basa teetni ugnak kotanak aafa chimanawuza. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Aaffa raajiisnu asuni safarak isanne aane yowawa. Sinuntano raajiison Korto Ayyanak zoonuste asuni meya Ha'ooskin odere makseterwa.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Eshni Assinynyani Meya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Sinuntano esha raajjuni meya daraasa ganeyasi feesetemato nitto ganeyaassi dey esh raajjuni meya foosonek chimonewa. Baasso tishu ephpha yaafa esha assu aachonon zi'unak zagsefe. Baassotin fure Daamiisin mormesere teetbesiista tishu baassosta teshshesefe. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Showobesiis iichu ugnak hamefe boor'a baasso wostoosik futoni ugnaas mechefa. <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Es eshni assinynyani meya waagni joorabesiistan teetbesiri tochooson wolumsefaafe nittotin meesefe. Showo wonaneen sinak mangsuni kar'a baassosta hoorera faarwa; futok tishutu baassotin oodaat faarwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Ha'oosi wosiyanikitonu boor'aason wostesefe kabaasik Ha'oos kenashtonoy talma doo'aassi mangsuni kar'ni wonaason oodonek shashsharak taar'a ke'oni dimaassi ha'i. <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/>Esiisimato ookoosi chowanon maket fe Noohnin ooma naafun asuni meyaneen ane fu'efaat Ha'ooson shiiphonoy asuni meya feesete daasta tishuni aka ephphe yaafana kabaasik keenashtera aane beya. <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/>Dey Ha'ooson shiiphonoy baassok ke'o sinonek Sodomnonnawa Gamoranonna kiichira bedna sinna tishuna kabaneen mangsu baassosta kar'i. <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/>Sinuntano tumaassi foonto mangu wostobesiisik diget fe ooko Looxnin fu'e. <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Es ooko asu baasso ganeyaassi feena kabaasik odet feena bariknawa biyet feena barikna kaabaas wonna wonna rakkatet faar. <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Ese han bar zuuttambaase ekka sinnanneen Daamiis barin shiiphet feese asuni meyanon fatanaassin aakkak fu'onamatonawa boor'ni meyanon dey aakkak ke'unamatonawa mangsuni kar'ni wonaasik oodde feenamatona arirwa uwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>Arkiron dey kiina sina ashni igubesiisik zoonustet Ha'oosi ha'suni hugnanon kashshit feese baassotin mangsuni kar'ni wonaasik ooddatu fa. Es esh assinynyani meya digonornawa beeganteser sinete boor'a den samaki ulfinto testoosikitonon me'esefe kabaasik aane digesefe. <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>Ha'oosi wosiyanikito hugnaknawa ha'sukna baassostan denalo sinefeknu Daamiisa sina mei'ni kaamak aane maksoto. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Sinuntano es esh assinynyani meya yaadatok chimonoyte wuzason me'esefewa. Es baasso oodtoknawa wortokna testoni safarabaasik faasefa kanuba foonto waagaasimatowa. Es waagaasikito tishifanaasimato baasso dey tishusone. <verse eid="2PE 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>Wostesete boor'aasik waagbesiison ephphetoosonewa; ashbesiison girsuk toosta sursefe kabaasik ma'a wuza zagsere faadisefe. Nittoneen ane muusonek teegtesefe kabaasik zinabesi feenar dey kiin sinefe. <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Wonna wonna gerkesni boor'aason sholet fa aafbesi faarwa. Amantoosik chimme yeronoy asuni meyanon dey esheterwa; dey eenanteseter; waaga jooreseter, dey erwutto meyawa. <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>Baasso ma'a ugnaason beyye daagsesetewa. Mangu wuzni wostok bestefa waagaason shuna Bi'orni naa Bala'amni ugnaasik hamete. <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>Sinuntano Bala'amnin boor'baasi boor'a Ha'oos barin ke'i. Wollok chimnoy hanyaas asuni noonok wollera raajjuusa nifaso wostonon yeeti.<verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Es asuni meya akaba foonto kor'aasne feeseterwa. Ipuwaasik tugtera hamfa sharuusne feeseterwa. Baassotin akama sitiitu talmatu oodaat faarwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Daagak feesefe asuni meeni ganeyaassin tesire kesa asuni meyanon ge'ni kaama maksefaafe ashak iguni safarak eshesefe. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>Baasso teetbesiisik boor'aasi boz sinere feefaat: «Birmadumma kesatirwa» yisefaafe ke'noy abdi imefe. Asu mertefena kabaasik es mere barik boz sinne waagtefenaasimato baasso dey boor'aasi bozwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Daamniisinnawa innotin fati Yesus Kiristoosninna arsere han daastaki kiinaassin oor kesetenneen orfo hepsa wolle es zeemoti kiinaasik oodtesere mertesefaatene zeemotiistan denalonon hepsani bartu akamanon baassosta faynirwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>Ookoni ugnaason arsetennen hankalo baassok imte korto ajajiistan orfo wolsobesiistan ookoni ugnaason aru shaksete sinfaanane baassok ma'ar sinana kabawa. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/>«Kanaas tooshna tooshaason muunak wolla hamfa» Esiisimato dey «Mukoos mastenanneen orfo wolla chamaassi bukalefa» yifa futoni besos baassosta kar'iwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Daamiisa Yooni Abdi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Inno meyane! Hash ta nittok tichunaas han hepsani wosiyaasongwa; han hep wosiyaason nittok tichinaas es wuzasikitonon yaadatok ma'a safaranti foonak nittotin guzgunakwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>Zeemoti korto raajjuni meya maksete kaamaasewa nitto wosini meyaki kamo daneti Daamni dey hetni sina basa ajajiise asin yaadatotik sholefawungwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/>Zuuttambaase asiistan zeemma han baron yaadatotiwa; koi'ni neyaastak mangu koosa koosayefe meenawa baasso teetni mangu eenantoosik zoonustoni kanyefe meena yoosonewa. <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>Baasso dey: «Daam Yesus yoonir yistera makte abdiis ayfaso? Zeemoti abani meya kitisetenneen hang testoos testenanneen kabira fa bar eekobaasetu fawa» yisefe. <verse eid="2PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/>Es baasso showo neyaneen sinak samaas Ha'oosi kaamak testobaason; daas dey testenaas akakinnawa akakna sinbaason arifettu mormesefewa. <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/>Es bari boor'a es kabati fa daason aka koor'a tishki. <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>Ha'ooson shiipho beyefe asuni meya; hashti fa samaasewa daase tishuna mangsuni kar'ni wonaasta es kaamaasik geyak hooreratu fawa.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>Inno meyane! Daamiiskik isa wonaas isa kuma wogga; isa kuma woggaas dey isa wona sinnamato es baron daagotiitawa. <verse eid="2PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Isa isa asuni meyak yoo woknirne feer sinnetu bestefe; sinuntano Daamiis abdini kaambaason zaguk aafa wokana wuza. Oonu tishunoynamatonawa asu zuuttambaase harmusonek sholefaattu nitto boor'a fakire fewa.<verse eid="2PE 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>Sinuntano Daamiisa wona diinqone wiisnimatotu yoona. Es wono han samaasikito akama kaamaktu tishusona. Testo zuuttambaase geyak kiichchera tishuna. Han daasewa barista faase wuzaasikitone zuuttera kiichchona. <verse eid="2PE 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Ese es wuzaasikito zuuttambaase esiisimato tishunir sinnanneen eekin nittok korto foosewa Ha'ooson shiiphet foone aakkak sholsu beynirinso? <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>Ese Ha'oosi wonni yoonon kaltanak oodet feernawa tai'nin dey yoonak wostet feerna sintiwa. Es wono samaas geyak kiichchera tishuna; testoos dey geyaasi kiichuk faalana. <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/>Sinuntano inno bar imna abdiisik ooko foos kaputtona gaddo samaasewa gaddo daase asintu oodet faani. <verse eid="2PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Es bari boor'a inno meyane! Es wuzaasikito sinana wonaason oodet faatir sinfaanane Daamiis zinanti wedey mudanti foonto sinna nagak faani dananak guzira footiwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Daamiisa fakiya nitto farutik sinnamato aruti. Shunto ayni Phawulos barik imte techmaasik nittok tichinaas esiisongwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>Bar es wuzaasik basa wosiyaasikitonon haniisimato tichi. Wosibaasikitosin isa isar galonor faaser. Arubesi yo'ina ek hang yisefe baasso ooma ooma korto matsafaasikitonon elingsisefeesimato han wuzasikitonon dey elingsisefe. Es baron dey zagsefees teetbesiisik tishusonekwa.<verse eid="2PE 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Sinuntano inno meyane! Es baron zeemma arseti boor'a manguni meeni daagsuusik zattera chimma yereti baristan gandonoytimato teetnitiison oodtiwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Es baristan denalo Daamni dey hetni sina Yesus Kiristoosni otmaasiknawa barin dey arukna dichchi. Barik hashnu koi'ba foontonon ulfina sinfawung; aamin.<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
